{"version":1,"content":"<p>歌手蔡楓華(Ken)今日（28日）正日生日，重返回母校見證學校師生建下展示7448隻的「最多毛巾熊公仔」世界紀錄。</p><p>Ken一貫Cap帽及黑超造型，身穿風褸襯波鞋 雖然行路時緩慢，上落樓梯雖要人攙扶，但精神好，對在場粉絲大叫「師兄」、「好靚仔」</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T10:57:37.838753+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T10:29:35+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T10:50:56.164106+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T10:50:56.164106+00:00","content_hash":"68c86f8e5ac40b4ccbd39cc519aa68a6721430733362a0032f7c9517ecb14e28","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}